Description: XLibre X server -- void input driver
 This package provides the void input driver, which never actually registers
 any input events -- it is, as such, a 'fake' driver.
 .
 More information about XLibre can be found at:
 <URL:https://www.github.com/X11Libre/xserver>
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-input-void driver module.
Conflicts:
 xserver-xorg-input-void,
